\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Holy, and true, and righteos Lord,
\par I wait to prove Thy perfect will;
\par Be mindful about Thy gracious word,
\par And stamp me with Thy Spirit's seal.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Confound, o'erpower me by Thy grace,
\par I would be by myself abhorred;
\par All might, all majesty, all praise,
\par All glory, be to Christ my Lord.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Now let me gain perfections's height,
\par Now let me into nothing fall,
\par Be less than nothing in Thy sight,
\par And feel that Christ is all in all.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

